### Create an employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Grace",
  "lastName": "Hopper",
  "email": "grace@example.com",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "position": "Backend Developer",
  "salary": 62000.00
}

### Create a second employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alan",
  "lastName": "Turing",
  "email": "alan@example.com",
  "department": "Research",
  "position": "Principal Engineer",
  "salary": 98000.00
}

### List all employees (paged)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees?page=0&size=20&sort=lastName,asc

### Search by keyword
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees?search=hop

### Filter by department
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees?department=Engineering

### Get employee by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/1

### Update employee
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Grace",
  "lastName": "Hopper",
  "email": "grace@example.com",
  "department": "Research",
  "position": "Principal Engineer",
  "salary": 95000.00
}

### Delete employee
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/1

### --- Error scenarios ---

### 400 validation error
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "X",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "department": "",
  "position": "",
  "salary": -5
}

### 404 not found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees/9999

### 409 duplicate email
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Grace",
  "lastName": "Hopper",
  "email": "grace@example.com",
  "department": "Engineering",
  "position": "Backend Developer",
  "salary": 62000.00
}
